        "carousel_1_image": "shopify://shop_images/FD7231F1-01ED-4B52-8882-17A475D74AA1.png",
        "carousel_1_title": "Real Ceylon From Sri Lanka",
        "carousel_1_body": "Most cinnamon supplements use Cassia. Avonent uses real Ceylon cinnamon from Sri Lanka. We concentrate it 12:1 to equal 14,400 mg of raw cinnamon per dose. True Ceylon is naturally low in coumarin. That matters if you are over 50 and plan to take it every day for years, not just a few weeks.",
