        "carousel_2_body": "Berberine helps your body handle sugar and carbs better. It supports lower blood sugar, healthier cholesterol, normal blood pressure, and weight loss. Avonent puts 400 mg in every softgel so you get it in one simple daily dose. No extra bottle needed.",
