        "carousel_3_title": "MCT Oil Delivery",
        "carousel_3_body": "The active compounds in Ceylon cinnamon are fat-soluble. Without a fat carrier, most of them pass through your body unused. Regular capsules and powders have very low absorption. Avonent suspends the extract in MCT oil inside a softgel so it can reach your bloodstream. This gives you over 99% absorption so you get the full effects of the product.",
