        "carousel_4_title": "14,400 mg Potency. Not Underdosed.",
        "carousel_4_body": "Most cinnamon supplements underdose you. A few hundred milligrams of powder is not enough to matter. One Avonent softgel delivers a full therapeutic-level dose equal to 14,400 mg of raw Ceylon cinnamon. The softgels are easy to swallow, so you do not have to take a handful of capsules or mix powder into your coffee."
